# AInstien Research

Use this rule when the user asks to start, continue, organize, understand, evaluate, experiment on, or write research.

Read the canonical skill before acting:

`skills/ainstien-research/SKILL.md`

Follow its routing model. Keep separate projects under `research-states/<project-slug>/`, update the active research state, and create other artifacts only when the workflow calls for them.

For long research sessions, end with selected journey slug, current stage, paper-readiness status, and next best research action.
